      "summary": "Every agent result, and the partial result a rejected call carries, says what produced it: `identity` holds the SHA-256 of the base system prompt, the canonical SHA-256 of the listed tool definitions sorted by name, the tool names, the configured provider and model, and every model the provider reported answering. A host stores it beside the run so an evaluation names the prompt and tool versions it measured, and a changed prompt or schema shows as a changed digest. `@tangleai/agents` now depends directly on `@jarenjs/json`, which was already in its closure.",
      "id": "run-identity"
    }
